## 2. Intake Form (Public Lead Capture)

Lives at `/app/intake/page.tsx` — already scaffolded.

### Form Fields

| Field | Type | Required | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|
| `full_name` | text | yes | "Nombre completo" |
| `business_name` | text | yes | "¿Qué negocio tienes?" |
| `website_url` | text | **no** | Placeholder: "Si no tienes, déjalo en blanco" |
| `business_location` | text | yes | "Ubicación del negocio" |
| `reason` | textarea | yes | "¿Por qué quieres actualizar o crear tu sitio web?" |
| `brand_assets` | multi-select | yes | Checkboxes: Logo / Colores / Fotos / Ninguno |
| `email` | email | yes | Auto-creates user shell on submit |

### Lead Scoring (server-side, admin-only view)

Compute `lead_score` on submission:
- Has website → +1 (established business)
- Has brand assets (not "Ninguno") → +2
- Major MX metro (CDMX, Monterrey, Guadalajara) → +1
- Reason mentions "actualizar" → +1 upsell flag

Color bands: 0–1 Red, 2–3 Yellow, 4+ Green.

### API Route

`app/api/intake/route.ts` — POST handler that validates, scores, stores, and optionally triggers admin email notification via Resend.

